# Design sources.
#
# GitHub hard-rejects any single file over 100MB, and the push fails for the whole
# commit -- by which point the blob is already in history and only a rewrite gets it
# out. The Rev 1 landing and lose sources were 243MB and 222MB, so they stay local
# and only their PNG/WebP exports are committed.
#
# The PSDs already tracked under "Fanta Horror_Q3_26/RAW FILE" are unaffected: an
# ignore rule never applies to a file git is already tracking.
#
# Need to commit a small one anyway? Force it: git add -f path/to/file.psd
*.psd

# Stray copy of the "Sound baru" delivery that landed outside the project folder.
# The clips that survived it now ship transcoded in FantaHorror/assets/sounds/.
/Sound baru/

# Claude Code local tooling -- not part of the client deliverable.
.claude/
